= Ask, don't search <assistant>
The assistant reads your project, checks the
compiler's diagnostics and looks up the Typst
documentation @typstdocs. It can run on your Mac
with Apple Intelligence or with your own key, and
nothing leaves your Mac until you agree.

Every change it makes shows up as a diff, with
one click to revert:

```typ
#set page(numbering: "1 / 1")
```

Select any passage and choose Explain with AI.
